s work correctly for listing, creating, responding, and archiving\"}],\"model\":\"kimi-for-coding\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":73983,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"prompt_tokens\":73983,\"cached_tokens\":0},\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"fda141f5-a3a9-4f60-9302-36b25383cb2b\",\"uuid\":\"b6ba1b6e-616a-43a7-90f4-dd8dc55d2538\"}\n{\"type\":\"result\",\"subtype\":\"success\",\"is_error\":false,\"duration_ms\":324827,\"duration_api_ms\":340428,\"num_turns\":57,\"result\":\"I have successfully completed the implementation of human input file support. Here's a summary of what was done:\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\n### Created Files:\\n1. **`tools/se3_tools/human_input.py`** - Core module for file-based human input handling with:\\n   - `HumanInput` dataclass for representing input files\\n   - `HumanInputStore` class for managing input files (parse, write response, archive)\\n   - Support for Context, Request, and Response sections\\n   - Multi-language support (English, Chinese, French headers)\\n   - Meaningful response detection (excludes HTML comments and placeholders)\\n\\n2. **`tools/se3_tools/commands/human_input.py`** - CLI command implementation with:\\n   - `se3 human-input --list` - List pending input files\\n   - `se3 human-input --file <path>` - Read and process an input file\\n   - `se3 human-input --read <id>` - Read a specific input by ID\\n   - `se3 human-input template <title>` - Create a new input template\\n   - `se3 human-input respond <id> <response>` - Write response and archive\\n\\n3. **`tests/test_human_input.py`** - Comprehensive test suite (21 tests)\\n\\n4. **`human-inputs/`** directory structure with `archive/` subdirectory\\n\\n### Modified Files:\\n1. **`tools/se3_tools/cli.py`** - Registered the new `human-input` command\\n2. **`tools/se3_tools/__init__.py`** - Bumped version to